    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Yes, I used a simple AI tool last year to check my algebra steps. It helped me verify my work and explain concepts in plain language. I found it useful for reinforcing basics, especially when I was reviewing for a self-study course. It didn’t replace my thinking, but it gave me confidence and made learning less intimidating.",
